://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99530","id":2493520716,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UoBtM","user":{"login":"Tugsav","id":3738264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MzgyNjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3738264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tugsav","html_url":"https://github.com/Tugsav","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tugsav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tugsav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tugsav/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tugsav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tugsav/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tugsav/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tugsav/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tugsav/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tugsav/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-22T11:19:22Z","updated_at":"2024-11-22T11:19:22Z","body":"> Can you please try a more recent and supported version? Like 3.5.3 or 3.6? To make sure this is still occuring and hasn't been fixed already\n\nI tried 3.6-stable, and the bug is also present there","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2493520716/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2493816988","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99530#issuecomment-2493816988","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99530","id":2493816988,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UpKCc","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-22T13:51:03Z","updated_at":"2024-11-22T14:13:50Z","body":"Would be useful to see if it occurs in earlier builds (3.3 / 3.4).\n\nRelated, see #97175 - If you are using physics interpolation, it isn't recommended to try with multithreaded.\n\nThis is the MRP hosted here, it's usually better to upload MRP to our github directly, so the MRP is still available in 5 years time. 😀 \n[godot-particle2d-multithreading-bug-main.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17871097/godot-particle2d-multithreading-bug-main.zip)\n\nHaving a look, I made some changes here for 3.6 for 2d physics interpolation, but this area of this `frame_pre_draw` signal is the same as before afaik, and given that the bug is reported in 3.5, it likely has existed for some time.\n\nI'm not sure many people use multithreaded rendering, and race condition bugs can be rare as with this one (I haven't been able to reproduce so far) - I personally avoid multithread mode myself (maybe there's some situation you need it like in #97175) ..  it doesn't get as widely bug tested.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2493816988/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2802947940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99530#issuecomment-2802947940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99530","id":2802947940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nEZdk","user":{"login":"Nallebeorn","id":7013489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTM0ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7013489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Nallebeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T20:47:18Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T20:47:18Z","body":"I left the MRP with time scale at 50 running for ~30 min and never got an error. I ran it again (also with time scale 50) after restarting Godot and got the error 4 times almost instantly. Haven't been able to reproduce again since.\n\n```\nERROR: Error calling method from signal 'frame_pre_draw': 'CPUParticles2D::': Method not found..\n   at: emit_signal (core/object.cpp:1244)\n\n```\nGodot 3.6-stable, Windows 11, Nvidia Geforce RTX 4070, AMD Ryzen 5 7600X\n\n@AThousandShips ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2802947940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]